    {
      "source": "Performs standard JavaBean property access, also supporting nested\nproperties. Normally, application code will work with the\n<code>Errors</code> interface or the <code>BindingResult</code> interface.\nA <a href=\"DataBinder.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.validation\"><code>DataBinder</code></a> returns its <code>BindingResult</code> via\n<a href=\"DataBinder.html#getBindingResult()\"><code>DataBinder.getBindingResult()</code></a>.",
      "translation": "执行标准的 JavaBean 属性访问，同时也支持嵌套属性。通常，应用程序代码将使用<code>Errors</code>接口或<code>BindingResult</code>接口。<a href=\"DataBinder.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.validation\"><code>DataBinder</code></a>通过<a href=\"DataBinder.html#getBindingResult()\"><code>DataBinder.getBindingResult()</code></a>返回其<code>BindingResult</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
